OL,3,GNEWSADefence analyst beats US Office
OL,4,Astar and MSP for university rector job
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ministry of Defence analyst has been
OL,7,Felected rector of the University of St
OL,8,FAndrews.
OL,10,FDr Arthur Bernhoff saw off US Office
OL,11,Factor Brian Baumgartner - who finished
OL,12,Fsecond - and Scottish Green MSP Q
OL,13,FManivannan, who came third.
OL,15,FBernhoff, a St Andrews graduate who
OL,16,Flives locally, has pledged to be a
OL,17,F"present, listening, and effective"
OL,18,Frector, and will take up his post on 1
OL,19,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
